(5413469, 778360, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it. The highlights and hot pixels don''t detract from this image much at all.  I would have liked to see a little less top - maybe crop a third of the image off the top would be much more effective scene.</td>', 'I like it. The highlights and hot pixels don''t detract from this image much at all.  I would have liked to see a little less top - maybe crop a third of the image off the top would be much more effective scene.', '2009-04-01 20:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413472, 778330, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between a modern interpretation of an ancient structure and an acutal old structure. Very crisp over all although the lights on the left side of the image are distracting and reduce the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'Interesting contrast between a modern interpretation of an ancient structure and an acutal old structure. Very crisp over all although the lights on the left side of the image are distracting and reduce the overall impact of the image.', '2009-04-01 20:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413475, 778582, 101256, '<td valign="top">Stong, effective and very interesting.  I think the odd angle hurts this image, but I can''t complain about the detail which is wonderful.</td>', 'Stong, effective and very interesting.  I think the odd angle hurts this image, but I can''t complain about the detail which is wonderful.', '2009-04-01 20:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413479, 776740, 101256, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus - I can''t tell if that was intentional or not. The image isn''t as crisp as an image of this type should be. What it lacks in execution is not balanced by an excellant composition - if it were more in focus, it would be a great image to print.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus - I can''t tell if that was intentional or not. The image isn''t as crisp as an image of this type should be. What it lacks in execution is not balanced by an excellant composition - if it were more in focus, it would be a great image to print.', '2009-04-01 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413481, 776547, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy images like this - spooky, ethereal in some ways, menacing - very well done.  The little flaws with the overly dark foreground on the right can''t be overlooked, but again, very effective image.</td>', 'I really enjoy images like this - spooky, ethereal in some ways, menacing - very well done.  The little flaws with the overly dark foreground on the right can''t be overlooked, but again, very effective image.', '2009-04-01 20:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413483, 778033, 98647, '<td valign="top">Love the bokeh on this.</td>', 'Love the bokeh on this.', '2009-04-01 20:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413484, 774032, 101256, '<td valign="top">I should give this a ten because I fly a R44 also.  :&gt;)  I like it if only because of the common interest, but I can''t really give it a better than average score - the image does nothing for me at all.</td>', 'I should give this a ten because I fly a R44 also.  :>)  I like it if only because of the common interest, but I can''t really give it a better than average score - the image does nothing for me at all.', '2009-04-01 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413485, 778617, 101256, '<td valign="top">Definetly a ten - I can''t say enough good things about this image - I''d have to use a thesaurus to properly convey the impact, beauty and sheer excellance of this image.  The highlight whites, blues and reds are right on the edge of being over done - simply beautiful.</td>', 'Definetly a ten - I can''t say enough good things about this image - I''d have to use a thesaurus to properly convey the impact, beauty and sheer excellance of this image.  The highlight whites, blues and reds are right on the edge of being over done - simply beautiful.', '2009-04-01 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413487, 778397, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''d like to give this a ten, but the sky is ineffective against the bright skyline.  It also looks a little oversharpened - or so it seems.</td>', 'I''d like to give this a ten, but the sky is ineffective against the bright skyline.  It also looks a little oversharpened - or so it seems.', '2009-04-01 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413489, 776579, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love the different hues.  It seems a little darker than it should be, but its very well done - nice capture.</td>', 'Love the different hues.  It seems a little darker than it should be, but its very well done - nice capture.', '2009-04-01 20:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413491, 777412, 101256, '<td valign="top">And the approaching car veers to the left and so much for big city love. :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Nice capture - does nothing for me personally, but it''s interesting. As a candid it doesn''t evoke any feelings one way or the other - I''m just not moved by this at all.</td>', 'And the approaching car veers to the left and so much for big city love. :>) Nice capture - does nothing for me personally, but it''s interesting. As a candid it doesn''t evoke any feelings one way or the other - I''m just not moved by this at all.', '2009-04-01 20:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413492, 777716, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well done, but the DOF problem detracts significantly from the images over all impact.</td>', 'Well done, but the DOF problem detracts significantly from the images over all impact.', '2009-04-01 20:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413495, 776557, 98647, '<td valign="top">Like the scene, but the colours are a little dull. It would be interesting to see it in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Like the scene, but the colours are a little dull. It would be interesting to see it in B&W.', '2009-04-01 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413496, 778464, 101256, '<td valign="top">A definite ten - you''ve captured the essence of danger and menace with this wonderful feline. I''ve come back to this twice and so far, it''s still my favorite image of the bunch in terms of animal images.<br/> <br/>Damn this is one hell of a picture.</td>', 'A definite ten - you''ve captured the essence of danger and menace with this wonderful feline. I''ve come back to this twice and so far, it''s still my favorite image of the bunch in terms of animal images. Damn this is one hell of a picture.', '2009-04-01 20:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413497, 778652, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellant - very nice - highly detailed and the DOF background suits the image perfectly.</td>', 'Excellant - very nice - highly detailed and the DOF background suits the image perfectly.', '2009-04-01 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413498, 774893, 101256, '<td valign="top">Delightfully asymetrically symetrical. Love the abstract real life feel to this. Nicely captured, plenty of detail, no flaws that I can see - a perfect image brilliantly composted and executed.</td>', 'Delightfully asymetrically symetrical. Love the abstract real life feel to this. Nicely captured, plenty of detail, no flaws that I can see - a perfect image brilliantly composted and executed.', '2009-04-01 20:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
