(5413500, 778357, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ah - the mischievous boy with a heart of gold and the devil in his eyes. Very nicely captured - well done.</td>', 'Ah - the mischievous boy with a heart of gold and the devil in his eyes. Very nicely captured - well done.', '2009-04-01 20:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413504, 773865, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images where the title/image nexus gets confused. I think I get what this image is saying, but I can''t decide if it''s fog or smoke - that''s what I mean about confused.  I think the title might have made more sense if there was actual fire in it, but thats a personal opinion.</td>', 'This is one of those images where the title/image nexus gets confused. I think I get what this image is saying, but I can''t decide if it''s fog or smoke - that''s what I mean about confused.  I think the title might have made more sense if there was actual fire in it, but thats a personal opinion.', '2009-04-01 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
