(5413533, 772077, 101256, '<td valign="top">A fairly standard image - nothing dynamic about it which is what you would like to see. I think all the white doesn''t do it any favors either.</td>', 'A fairly standard image - nothing dynamic about it which is what you would like to see. I think all the white doesn''t do it any favors either.', '2009-04-01 21:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413538, 777463, 101256, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is wonderful - the white aren''t blooming or over done and the composition is effective. For me though, the black detracts from it''s impact - needs something - some detail to truly make it a memorable image.</td>', 'Technically, this is wonderful - the white aren''t blooming or over done and the composition is effective. For me though, the black detracts from it''s impact - needs something - some detail to truly make it a memorable image.', '2009-04-01 21:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413539, 776516, 101256, '<td valign="top">Outstanding from a technical standpoint - the detail is amazing. Looking a little closer though, it appears to be over sharpened with a very slight halo around the edges of the birds and rail.</td>', 'Outstanding from a technical standpoint - the detail is amazing. Looking a little closer though, it appears to be over sharpened with a very slight halo around the edges of the birds and rail.', '2009-04-01 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413541, 778193, 98647, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity. I get the title but I would have preferred a symmetrical flower.</td>', 'Love the simplicity. I get the title but I would have preferred a symmetrical flower.', '2009-04-01 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413542, 778149, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to rate this to tell the truth. I like it, the fish eye effect is very interesting and the central focus gives the image a sublime unwordly feel.  It has no certain appeal which, I guess, is positive.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to rate this to tell the truth. I like it, the fish eye effect is very interesting and the central focus gives the image a sublime unwordly feel.  It has no certain appeal which, I guess, is positive.', '2009-04-01 21:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413547, 774724, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the title - Main Rousseau Bocher is a he.<br/> <br/>However the image is nicely composed. The soft texture of the conversion, the subtle shape of the subject and ribbons are nicely caught. Very effective.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the title - Main Rousseau Bocher is a he. However the image is nicely composed. The soft texture of the conversion, the subtle shape of the subject and ribbons are nicely caught. Very effective.', '2009-04-01 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
