(5414455, 777925, 31637, '<td valign="top">Sun looks great here, blending with the sky. Water is crisp and negative space is ok in this case, your sky benefits from the gradient fill, well done. 7</td>', 'Sun looks great here, blending with the sky. Water is crisp and negative space is ok in this case, your sky benefits from the gradient fill, well done. 7', '2009-04-02 03:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
