(5414459, 778092, 31637, '<td valign="top">Fantastic image, HDR looks just right, not over done, I like HDRs for Architecture.  You fit the frame well, diagonals split up the frame, building is amazing, looks sharp and the sky is very dooms-dayish, maybe why you chose title? 7</td>', 'Fantastic image, HDR looks just right, not over done, I like HDRs for Architecture.  You fit the frame well, diagonals split up the frame, building is amazing, looks sharp and the sky is very dooms-dayish, maybe why you chose title? 7', '2009-04-02 03:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414463, 778255, 31637, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait, crop, lighting, colors, just perfect. I feel this is what I would want my portraits to look like when I begin trying them. Negative space is good here on the sides, makes her more imposing. Her hairstyle is really cool, I must say, very futuristic. That 60s style with the makeup meets 2012 here. Eyes could be more smiting, but blonde hair is easy to overexpose. 9</td>', 'I like the portrait, crop, lighting, colors, just perfect. I feel this is what I would want my portraits to look like when I begin trying them. Negative space is good here on the sides, makes her more imposing. Her hairstyle is really cool, I must say, very futuristic. That 60s style with the makeup meets 2012 here. Eyes could be more smiting, but blonde hair is easy to overexpose. 9', '2009-04-02 03:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
