(5414488, 776794, 32872, '<td valign="top">I''m such a fan of nightime shots...this is very striking.  I love it, especially the search lights and reflections...the entire image is lovely!!</td>', 'I''m such a fan of nightime shots...this is very striking.  I love it, especially the search lights and reflections...the entire image is lovely!!', '2009-04-02 04:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414513, 778504, 100393, '<td valign="top">A good idea but I think a much softer approach with softer focus, pastel shades, off centering of your subject and some overexposure might have been more interesting. No denying the crisp technicals here but I think an ''artier'' look might have made more of this this great opportunity.</td>', 'A good idea but I think a much softer approach with softer focus, pastel shades, off centering of your subject and some overexposure might have been more interesting. No denying the crisp technicals here but I think an ''artier'' look might have made more of this this great opportunity.', '2009-04-02 05:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414515, 777302, 100393, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is really good, as is the post processing. Despite the evident qualities of the model, the photography here is so good that it is those things I am marveling rather than the subject - and given the subject, that''s quite a feat you''ve pulled off!</td>', 'The lighting here is really good, as is the post processing. Despite the evident qualities of the model, the photography here is so good that it is those things I am marveling rather than the subject - and given the subject, that''s quite a feat you''ve pulled off!', '2009-04-02 05:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414517, 776648, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think the post processing - especially noise reduction is a bit overdone. It''s still a good image but I''m sure the PP is masking a great image.</td>', 'I think the post processing - especially noise reduction is a bit overdone. It''s still a good image but I''m sure the PP is masking a great image.', '2009-04-02 05:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414541, 778035, 101531, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF is too shallow, only 1 small piece is in focus</td>', 'I think the DOF is too shallow, only 1 small piece is in focus', '2009-04-02 07:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414543, 778561, 101531, '<td valign="top">The colours lead your eye straight to the van, which isn''t what you want. I think there should be more foreground as in the rule of thirds.</td>', 'The colours lead your eye straight to the van, which isn''t what you want. I think there should be more foreground as in the rule of thirds.', '2009-04-02 07:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414550, 777896, 101256, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, but there is something that I don''t like that I can''t put my finger on.  The vines are a a nicely formed mass and interesting, but I think the overall green and odd wall angle are distracting.</td>', 'I want to like this, but there is something that I don''t like that I can''t put my finger on.  The vines are a a nicely formed mass and interesting, but I think the overall green and odd wall angle are distracting.', '2009-04-02 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414552, 776819, 101256, '<td valign="top">Looks like a set from "Logan''s Run".  The washed out sky doens''t help this image any - even with a tight crop of the sky.</td>', 'Looks like a set from "Logan''s Run".  The washed out sky doens''t help this image any - even with a tight crop of the sky.', '2009-04-02 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414554, 776604, 101531, '<td valign="top">I think a better crop to get rid of some of the distracting foreground would have made this better, but nice view. Just the city alone would have been nice too</td>', 'I think a better crop to get rid of some of the distracting foreground would have made this better, but nice view. Just the city alone would have been nice too', '2009-04-02 07:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414556, 778385, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like what you did here - it''s amusing and clever. I wonder though, how many people would bother to scroll down to find the cow? I think this would have worked better with a small crop from the top so you get the whole image when you click on it. Well done though - great idea and great execution.</td>', 'I like what you did here - it''s amusing and clever. I wonder though, how many people would bother to scroll down to find the cow? I think this would have worked better with a small crop from the top so you get the whole image when you click on it. Well done though - great idea and great execution.', '2009-04-02 07:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414557, 778439, 101256, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect -  unfortunate that the wings got clipped from the framing of the image.</td>', 'Almost perfect -  unfortunate that the wings got clipped from the framing of the image.', '2009-04-02 07:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414559, 778504, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color and the model is interesting, but there isn''t anything dynamic about the image.  This is one of those images that begs for a heavy dose of special effects to really make it pop. Unfortunately, that''s not allowed, so keeping within the spirit of the rules, it''s well done.</td>', 'Interesting use of color and the model is interesting, but there isn''t anything dynamic about the image.  This is one of those images that begs for a heavy dose of special effects to really make it pop. Unfortunately, that''s not allowed, so keeping within the spirit of the rules, it''s well done.', '2009-04-02 07:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414560, 777923, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well done - nicely detailed and effective DOF control.</td>', 'Well done - nicely detailed and effective DOF control.', '2009-04-02 07:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414564, 778634, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s really unfortunate that the angle forced DOF problems - this would have been the best abstract in all of 475 images. You might have avoided this by taking the image at a 90 degree angle and using an off camera light to create the cats eye effect on the drops.</td>', 'It''s really unfortunate that the angle forced DOF problems - this would have been the best abstract in all of 475 images. You might have avoided this by taking the image at a 90 degree angle and using an off camera light to create the cats eye effect on the drops.', '2009-04-02 07:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5414565, 777357, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, contrasting colors, and detail on your subjects. Best macro in the bunch so far! Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful composition, contrasting colors, and detail on your subjects. Best macro in the bunch so far! Congrats!', '2009-04-02 07:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
