(5414596, 778393, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. It''s not over sharpened, but it''s right on the edge. It has a very interesting 3D effect. Having said that, it seems unbalanced with the smoother backdrop on the right - might have been a better image if the wrinkles had carried over.</td>', 'Interesting image. It''s not over sharpened, but it''s right on the edge. It has a very interesting 3D effect. Having said that, it seems unbalanced with the smoother backdrop on the right - might have been a better image if the wrinkles had carried over.', '2009-04-02 08:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
