(5416071, 778593, 42495, '<td valign="top">I really like the subtle tones and detail.  You''ve given your subject a lot of space to talk into and that older building on left looks like a good destination.</td>', 'I really like the subtle tones and detail.  You''ve given your subject a lot of space to talk into and that older building on left looks like a good destination.', '2009-04-02 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
