(5416139, 778665, 42495, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This photo is just so full of mystery and intrigue, and the technicals are well done.  I so much want your model to walk into the light, and that drama makes this a great photo.  It''s been a while since I''ve seen one this good on DPC.</td>', 'WOW!  This photo is just so full of mystery and intrigue, and the technicals are well done.  I so much want your model to walk into the light, and that drama makes this a great photo.  It''s been a while since I''ve seen one this good on DPC.', '2009-04-03 00:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5416143, 771240, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''ve thought about taking a crocus picture but they seemed boring.  You proved me wrong.</td>', 'I''ve thought about taking a crocus picture but they seemed boring.  You proved me wrong.', '2009-04-03 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
