(5417105, 778176, 66967, '<td valign="top">Your focus on the single blade of grass (or whatever that is) is great, and the DOF is gorgeous. The colors are lovely too. I actually think this would be better without the fly. The fly is just out of focus enough that it is distracting, and makes me wish it would fly away so I could see the scene without it. All just MHO.</td>', 'Your focus on the single blade of grass (or whatever that is) is great, and the DOF is gorgeous. The colors are lovely too. I actually think this would be better without the fly. The fly is just out of focus enough that it is distracting, and makes me wish it would fly away so I could see the scene without it. All just MHO.', '2009-04-03 16:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417111, 775279, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great image, great character study.  Nice DOF, brilliant blue eyes.</td>', 'Great image, great character study.  Nice DOF, brilliant blue eyes.', '2009-04-03 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417112, 776640, 67258, '<td valign="top">I opened this yesterday evening after returning from the quiz night at The Last Drop Inn on Colliergate in York, and a pint  of Guzzler - it was very, very weird!  I think on balance I prefer Terrier to Guzzler.<br/> <br/>Oh, the photo - pretty good!<br/> <br/>Edit - I meant the coincidence was weird, not the beer!</td>', 'I opened this yesterday evening after returning from the quiz night at The Last Drop Inn on Colliergate in York, and a pint  of Guzzler - it was very, very weird!  I think on balance I prefer Terrier to Guzzler. Oh, the photo - pretty good! Edit - I meant the coincidence was weird, not the beer!', '2009-04-03 16:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417113, 777514, 67258, '<td valign="top">Rather lovely!</td>', 'Rather lovely!', '2009-04-03 16:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417115, 778665, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very enigmatic - a photo that draws the viewer in.  The strength of the light an contrast is almost theatrical.  A strong photo, and one to view again.</td>', 'Very enigmatic - a photo that draws the viewer in.  The strength of the light an contrast is almost theatrical.  A strong photo, and one to view again.', '2009-04-03 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
