(5418774, 777311, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Looks like this image may not be appreciated at this size and the detail might be there ''wall sized'' - nice scene and image although I wonder about a variation in the cropping - not sure how, just seems a little off balance.  I''m guessing others have pointed out the typo.</td>', '7 - Looks like this image may not be appreciated at this size and the detail might be there ''wall sized'' - nice scene and image although I wonder about a variation in the cropping - not sure how, just seems a little off balance.  I''m guessing others have pointed out the typo.', '2009-04-04 18:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
