(5420006, 778237, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good, moody street photography. I almost slapped a quick 4 on it, but then I had a second glance and decided it had a certain something that my first quick glance did not show. I like the way the two faces almost seem to mirror each other, but the woman on the right is sort of smiling and contrasts with the woman on the left.</td>', 'Good, moody street photography. I almost slapped a quick 4 on it, but then I had a second glance and decided it had a certain something that my first quick glance did not show. I like the way the two faces almost seem to mirror each other, but the woman on the right is sort of smiling and contrasts with the woman on the left.', '2009-04-05 21:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420008, 776640, 31637, '<td valign="top">Definitely !! Interesting microbrewer brands here, the Dark Mild sounds good, a bit weak for my tastes tho... I would like hte other tap on the right to be seen in full</td>', 'Definitely !! Interesting microbrewer brands here, the Dark Mild sounds good, a bit weak for my tastes tho... I would like hte other tap on the right to be seen in full', '2009-04-05 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
