(5420024, 778541, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good perspective, though it might need a little more saturation, contrast or something to give it that high scoring DPC "wow-factor". Certainly has the potential within the capture though. Good camera work. Just needs some finessing in PP. I''ll be curious to see where this one places.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good perspective, though it might need a little more saturation, contrast or something to give it that high scoring DPC "wow-factor". Certainly has the potential within the capture though. Good camera work. Just needs some finessing in PP. I''ll be curious to see where this one places.', '2009-04-05 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420030, 776484, 83313, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF help bring my attention to the eyes. Nice work on this one. A fave for it.</td>', 'The shallow DOF help bring my attention to the eyes. Nice work on this one. A fave for it.', '2009-04-05 21:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
