(5420857, 777862, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to really make of this, but I find it intriguing. Not everything has to have a message though. Interesting method. I prefer to go out to my car during lunch for my own midday power naps.</td>', 'Not sure what to really make of this, but I find it intriguing. Not everything has to have a message though. Interesting method. I prefer to go out to my car during lunch for my own midday power naps.', '2009-04-06 02:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
