(5420876, 777907, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, interesting looking bird. Some additional bump in saturation and perhaps contrast may have given this some more visual impact and a bump in score. Still gets a 6 from me for the really good camera work.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, interesting looking bird. Some additional bump in saturation and perhaps contrast may have given this some more visual impact and a bump in score. Still gets a 6 from me for the really good camera work.', '2009-04-06 02:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
