(5420894, 770129, 83313, '<td valign="top">I tried to photograph some of these recently on my trip to New Mexico, but they were too far from the highway and a side trip was not in the schedule.</td>', 'I tried to photograph some of these recently on my trip to New Mexico, but they were too far from the highway and a side trip was not in the schedule.', '2009-04-06 02:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420901, 775165, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you have already been told it is too small, but there is also way too much compression. At only 26k in file size, the jpeg compression is killing a lot of detail on you. Always use the least compression that you can and make it under the file size limit for the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sure you have already been told it is too small, but there is also way too much compression. At only 26k in file size, the jpeg compression is killing a lot of detail on you. Always use the least compression that you can and make it under the file size limit for the challenge.', '2009-04-06 02:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5420903, 777747, 102581, '<td valign="top">Seems overprocessed....</td>', 'Seems overprocessed....', '2009-04-06 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
