(5422894, 774097, 83313, '<td valign="top">Way too small, you should use the entire 720 pixels in at least one direction. There is also a ton of compression here. Your file size is only 25k and you could have used up to 200k. Use as little compression as you must to fit challenge limits. Compression kills detail.</td>', 'Way too small, you should use the entire 720 pixels in at least one direction. There is also a ton of compression here. Your file size is only 25k and you could have used up to 200k. Use as little compression as you must to fit challenge limits. Compression kills detail.', '2009-04-06 22:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
