(5422899, 775407, 83313, '<td valign="top">The detail here seems rather coarse, as if this is a close crop. I''m afraid the focus does not seem to quite be spot on, either. It seems slightly OOF on the ducks face and more in focus on his back. Focus can be tricky. I often find when reviewing my shots that the focus is just slightly off from perfect. Not sure if there is anything I can suggest here.</td>', 'The detail here seems rather coarse, as if this is a close crop. I''m afraid the focus does not seem to quite be spot on, either. It seems slightly OOF on the ducks face and more in focus on his back. Focus can be tricky. I often find when reviewing my shots that the focus is just slightly off from perfect. Not sure if there is anything I can suggest here.', '2009-04-06 22:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
