(5423664, 778255, 68546, '<td valign="top">I''m really torn on this one because the model, expression, makeup, lighting, hair, and focus are all fantastic. But, I really don''t like the crop and composition, I''m not at all adversed to tight crops and central compositions but I don''t think it works here. The crop is either too tight or not tight enough, it''s like the frame is fitting round the head rather then positioned and then the central composition adds to the discomfort of that. Still love it though, great lighting</td>', 'I''m really torn on this one because the model, expression, makeup, lighting, hair, and focus are all fantastic. But, I really don''t like the crop and composition, I''m not at all adversed to tight crops and central compositions but I don''t think it works here. The crop is either too tight or not tight enough, it''s like the frame is fitting round the head rather then positioned and then the central composition adds to the discomfort of that. Still love it though, great lighting', '2009-04-07 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
