(5424129, 778385, 811, '<td valign="top">i love minimalistic styles of photography.<br/>i love negative space.<br/> <br/>i love this picture.</td>', 'i love minimalistic styles of photography.i love negative space. i love this picture.', '2009-04-07 15:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424143, 778313, 6999, '<td valign="top">Marvellous; I feel that I ought to have seen this shot a thousand times, and yet I don''t believe I''ve ever seen it before. Excellent photography.</td>', 'Marvellous; I feel that I ought to have seen this shot a thousand times, and yet I don''t believe I''ve ever seen it before. Excellent photography.', '2009-04-07 15:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424145, 775560, 6999, '<td valign="top">Amazing that a simple glimpse of red always brings to mind ''Don''t Look Now''. I like the graininess of this, the sense of a glimpse and then a missingness; like catching something out of the corner of your eye, and when you turn, it''s gone.</td>', 'Amazing that a simple glimpse of red always brings to mind ''Don''t Look Now''. I like the graininess of this, the sense of a glimpse and then a missingness; like catching something out of the corner of your eye, and when you turn, it''s gone.', '2009-04-07 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424147, 777862, 6999, '<td valign="top">A fine portrait; if he is ''napping'', then it seems as if it is a difficult fight to keep out the disturbance, perhaps only the disturbance of that art.</td>', 'A fine portrait; if he is ''napping'', then it seems as if it is a difficult fight to keep out the disturbance, perhaps only the disturbance of that art.', '2009-04-07 15:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424148, 776595, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perhaps simply that it''s so very ordinary, and yet so very well composed. That all routes through here lead one''s eye back to that pale building.</td>', 'Perhaps simply that it''s so very ordinary, and yet so very well composed. That all routes through here lead one''s eye back to that pale building.', '2009-04-07 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424149, 774506, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition; particular suggestions of an almost cubist vision, really - that we might see from moe than one angle at once.</td>', 'Very strong composition; particular suggestions of an almost cubist vision, really - that we might see from moe than one angle at once.', '2009-04-07 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424150, 778665, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ah, good. You''ve saved me from giving up and going to sit in the garden. A most groovy image.</td>', 'Ah, good. You''ve saved me from giving up and going to sit in the garden. A most groovy image.', '2009-04-07 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424155, 778339, 14867, '<td valign="top">Dark and powerful, superb toning.</td>', 'Dark and powerful, superb toning.', '2009-04-07 15:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424162, 778495, 14867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mixing of motion and warm light. <br/>I could also appreciate it (probably better) without the unclear and complicated left quarter.</td>', 'Beautiful mixing of motion and warm light. I could also appreciate it (probably better) without the unclear and complicated left quarter.', '2009-04-07 15:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424168, 770995, 14867, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, but lacking a bit of light and contrast in my opinion. Since you have nothing very strong in your composition, sun and shadows were needed. Or with that light, something like a strong perspective or leading line for the eye.</td>', 'Nice reflection, but lacking a bit of light and contrast in my opinion. Since you have nothing very strong in your composition, sun and shadows were needed. Or with that light, something like a strong perspective or leading line for the eye.', '2009-04-07 15:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424178, 774648, 5912, '<td valign="top">very sinister. Love it.</td>', 'very sinister. Love it.', '2009-04-07 15:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424281, 777758, 67258, '<td valign="top">Thoroughly impressive - has all the hallmarks of a MAK photo.</td>', 'Thoroughly impressive - has all the hallmarks of a MAK photo.', '2009-04-07 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424286, 777455, 67258, '<td valign="top">Back to comment - in my top 4 of the challenge.  The portrait is interesting, empathetic, natural and not contrived in appearance even if it did take a lot of posing!) and technically good.</td>', 'Back to comment - in my top 4 of the challenge.  The portrait is interesting, empathetic, natural and not contrived in appearance even if it did take a lot of posing!) and technically good.', '2009-04-07 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424307, 773462, 23430, '<td valign="top">Wow. Love this POV and the clouds.</td>', 'Wow. Love this POV and the clouds.', '2009-04-07 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424315, 777758, 23430, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of wide angle. I like how you can see around and down to all the different areas. The light and processing brings the best out of this grand old place too. Well done.</td>', 'Awesome use of wide angle. I like how you can see around and down to all the different areas. The light and processing brings the best out of this grand old place too. Well done.', '2009-04-07 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424336, 778109, 23430, '<td valign="top">Pretty good DOF for a macro. Love the clarity and a real interesting subject too.</td>', 'Pretty good DOF for a macro. Love the clarity and a real interesting subject too.', '2009-04-07 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424343, 778255, 23430, '<td valign="top">The centred composition works great here. I like the clean, crisp feel of this shot. Great model.</td>', 'The centred composition works great here. I like the clean, crisp feel of this shot. Great model.', '2009-04-07 17:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
