(5424384, 775766, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail but focus seems a bit off.</td>', 'Nice detail but focus seems a bit off.', '2009-04-07 18:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424387, 777214, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement here.</td>', 'Nice sense of movement here.', '2009-04-07 18:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424390, 778324, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fantabulous landscape!</td>', 'Fantabulous landscape!', '2009-04-07 18:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424454, 777909, 100831, '<td valign="top">fabulous!!</td>', 'fabulous!!', '2009-04-07 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424460, 777983, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract motion blur--I can still totally sense what is going on... I just wish it had more contrast--I think you could pull a lot more out of this image.</td>', 'I like the abstract motion blur--I can still totally sense what is going on... I just wish it had more contrast--I think you could pull a lot more out of this image.', '2009-04-07 19:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424521, 776312, 97976, '<td valign="top">Looks like an HDR in one shot amazing shot well done!</td>', 'Looks like an HDR in one shot amazing shot well done!', '2009-04-07 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424532, 776088, 97976, '<td valign="top">Nice image, like the duplication of the shot in the water. Love the way that the reflection of the ripples in the water seems to reflect in the sky (left of the tree) Seems stronger in the water than the sky and gives the illusion that the sky is reflecting the water. I like!</td>', 'Nice image, like the duplication of the shot in the water. Love the way that the reflection of the ripples in the water seems to reflect in the sky (left of the tree) Seems stronger in the water than the sky and gives the illusion that the sky is reflecting the water. I like!', '2009-04-07 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424538, 777909, 97976, '<td valign="top">Love this, vibrant, sharp and just lovely with the paw there as well. Makes you forget how scary they are when they yawn... Nice!</td>', 'Love this, vibrant, sharp and just lovely with the paw there as well. Makes you forget how scary they are when they yawn... Nice!', '2009-04-07 19:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424539, 777758, 58457, '<td valign="top">I wish I could afford a fish eye.  really cool shot.  It becomes esher-esque.  It would be fun to Photoshop some upside down people under the stairs.</td>', 'I wish I could afford a fish eye.  really cool shot.  It becomes esher-esque.  It would be fun to Photoshop some upside down people under the stairs.', '2009-04-07 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424544, 778255, 97976, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, great skin tones and I love the way her hair gets shorter closer to the shadow. (If it were not for the rules would you have softened the neck on the right a bit?) Nice shot!</td>', 'Lovely shot, great skin tones and I love the way her hair gets shorter closer to the shadow. (If it were not for the rules would you have softened the neck on the right a bit?) Nice shot!', '2009-04-07 19:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424547, 778253, 97976, '<td valign="top">This is a tough shot to get light on the front. Well done!</td>', 'This is a tough shot to get light on the front. Well done!', '2009-04-07 19:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424549, 769805, 97976, '<td valign="top">Love the composition! (sorry its so cut off from the background it feels like its shot on a black sheet) But still a great shot.</td>', 'Love the composition! (sorry its so cut off from the background it feels like its shot on a black sheet) But still a great shot.', '2009-04-07 20:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424580, 775892, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photographs that grows, expands, as you look at it.  For such a simple composition, it is very sophisticated.  The twin silos standing stark and splendid like a minor installation on another planet.  The stop sign suggests a rail crossing.  And the road makes a kind of sweeping salute to this lonely outpost before resuming its relentless crawl to the horizon.   And on the low hill, just in the corner, is a hint of a settlement.  Probably the people who feed these hungry silos.  Very fine picture.  8.</td>', 'This is one of those photographs that grows, expands, as you look at it.  For such a simple composition, it is very sophisticated.  The twin silos standing stark and splendid like a minor installation on another planet.  The stop sign suggests a rail crossing.  And the road makes a kind of sweeping salute to this lonely outpost before resuming its relentless crawl to the horizon.   And on the low hill, just in the corner, is a hint of a settlement.  Probably the people who feed these hungry silos.  Very fine picture.  8.', '2009-04-07 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424616, 778534, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I even have a rough idea where you took this from :-)</td>', 'Nice!  I even have a rough idea where you took this from :-)', '2009-04-07 21:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424619, 777357, 65234, '<td valign="top">The yellow in the background is perfectly placed.  Nice sharp detail; looks like he''s hanging on for dear life.</td>', 'The yellow in the background is perfectly placed.  Nice sharp detail; looks like he''s hanging on for dear life.', '2009-04-07 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424626, 777708, 65234, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective; I like it.  He''s blending into the river a bit but I guess that''s to his advantage in real life.</td>', 'Unusual perspective; I like it.  He''s blending into the river a bit but I guess that''s to his advantage in real life.', '2009-04-07 21:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424629, 777650, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Dog looks a bit pink on my monitor.</td>', 'Cute shot.  Dog looks a bit pink on my monitor.', '2009-04-07 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424630, 776724, 65234, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to hide behind a shrub!  That looks like a good-sized hawk.</td>', 'Makes me want to hide behind a shrub!  That looks like a good-sized hawk.', '2009-04-07 21:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424631, 778611, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice texture image, but upper left looks a touch blown...</td>', 'Nice texture image, but upper left looks a touch blown...', '2009-04-07 21:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424640, 772462, 103032, '<td valign="top">Clowns, puppets creep me out a bit...  But the main puppet has nice colors, nicely focused.  Nice DOF for the most part (although I would prefer the back puppets a little more out of focus.)  Overall a nicely captured image.</td>', 'Clowns, puppets creep me out a bit...  But the main puppet has nice colors, nicely focused.  Nice DOF for the most part (although I would prefer the back puppets a little more out of focus.)  Overall a nicely captured image.', '2009-04-07 21:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424641, 778637, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2009-04-07 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424643, 778523, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photograph.  It is rare to see this kind of thing done with genuine (rather than simulated) pathos.  The three seem merged into one by the bonds between them.  8.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photograph.  It is rare to see this kind of thing done with genuine (rather than simulated) pathos.  The three seem merged into one by the bonds between them.  8.', '2009-04-07 21:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424646, 778372, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love crow pictures.  Every one evokes a story.  This one''s an especially good one.  8.</td>', 'I love crow pictures.  Every one evokes a story.  This one''s an especially good one.  8.', '2009-04-07 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424649, 769631, 103032, '<td valign="top">As an abstract, it''s okay.  However, it has too much dead space on the left/lower left.  I don''t know, it doesn''t provide enough interest the way its composed....</td>', 'As an abstract, it''s okay.  However, it has too much dead space on the left/lower left.  I don''t know, it doesn''t provide enough interest the way its composed....', '2009-04-07 21:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424656, 776595, 30364, '<td valign="top">Might be easy to pass over this, because it''s so unassuming.  But it is a perfectly conceived and composed photograph. It''s about the meaning of the crossing.  I think about all the similar crossings in all the similar places, and what they have contributed to our lives.  It''s a very fine documentary photograph.  8.</td>', 'Might be easy to pass over this, because it''s so unassuming.  But it is a perfectly conceived and composed photograph. It''s about the meaning of the crossing.  I think about all the similar crossings in all the similar places, and what they have contributed to our lives.  It''s a very fine documentary photograph.  8.', '2009-04-07 21:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424660, 777862, 30364, '<td valign="top">Odd but compelling.  It seems beyond easy explanation; that''s always a good thing!  8.</td>', 'Odd but compelling.  It seems beyond easy explanation; that''s always a good thing!  8.', '2009-04-07 21:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424661, 778149, 103032, '<td valign="top">Lensbabies? I like Lensbabies shots, but the subject doesn''t provide a lot of interest.  Maybe if there was a bright colorful flower that pops, maybe if the fence was angled away... but the straight on shot and ivy that blends in with the foreground and background doesn''t provide any interest...</td>', 'Lensbabies? I like Lensbabies shots, but the subject doesn''t provide a lot of interest.  Maybe if there was a bright colorful flower that pops, maybe if the fence was angled away... but the straight on shot and ivy that blends in with the foreground and background doesn''t provide any interest...', '2009-04-07 21:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424665, 778520, 92907, '<td valign="top">great perspective....really like the black and white.</td>', 'great perspective....really like the black and white.', '2009-04-07 21:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424666, 778667, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition!  Just excellent in every way.  Oh how I wish the dreary bloody literalists would spend some time thinking about inspired compositions such as this, and might then hopefully stop bleating about bits being ''cropped'' out!   Pictures are not only about what''s inside the frame.  This one connects two worlds brilliantly by avoiding the isolating effect of convention.  Bravo!  9.</td>', 'Wonderful composition!  Just excellent in every way.  Oh how I wish the dreary bloody literalists would spend some time thinking about inspired compositions such as this, and might then hopefully stop bleating about bits being ''cropped'' out!   Pictures are not only about what''s inside the frame.  This one connects two worlds brilliantly by avoiding the isolating effect of convention.  Bravo!  9.', '2009-04-07 21:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424681, 776942, 103032, '<td valign="top">Main bird too centered in the photo.  Both birds are looking toward the left, so maybe if the big bird was placed in the right a bit more, it might have helped...  Personally I would have like the bird sharpened a touch more...</td>', 'Main bird too centered in the photo.  Both birds are looking toward the left, so maybe if the big bird was placed in the right a bit more, it might have helped...  Personally I would have like the bird sharpened a touch more...', '2009-04-07 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424682, 778237, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very fine.  We have unspoken connections, even unrecognized connections, with our fellow travelers in life.  It''s nice to celebrate them for that instant they exist.  It''s a decisive moment that neither of them were aware of.  8.</td>', 'This is very fine.  We have unspoken connections, even unrecognized connections, with our fellow travelers in life.  It''s nice to celebrate them for that instant they exist.  It''s a decisive moment that neither of them were aware of.  8.', '2009-04-07 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424693, 772849, 30364, '<td valign="top">Superb.  It''s hard to do a pet portrait that isn''t overly sentimental.  This isn''t.  It''s more of a character study.  A very good one.  8.</td>', 'Superb.  It''s hard to do a pet portrait that isn''t overly sentimental.  This isn''t.  It''s more of a character study.  A very good one.  8.', '2009-04-07 21:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424696, 778523, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice image, honest expression from the rancher.  Only critique is it looks a little left side heavy...  One of my favorite of this challenge.</td>', 'Nice image, honest expression from the rancher.  Only critique is it looks a little left side heavy...  One of my favorite of this challenge.', '2009-04-07 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424702, 777693, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very nice, these are very cool images.</td>', 'Very nice, these are very cool images.', '2009-04-07 21:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424704, 778665, 53548, '<td valign="top">shadow delight!!!</td>', 'shadow delight!!!', '2009-04-07 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424705, 778644, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve see thousands of gull shots, and taken a few dozen myself.  They''re sometimes amusing, occasionally funny, but only very rarely interesting beyond that.  This one breaks the chain ... it''s terrific.  My new all-time favorite in the genre.  It''s just such a startling point-of-view which I have probably seen many times myself without ever having actually seen it at all.  9.</td>', 'I''ve see thousands of gull shots, and taken a few dozen myself.  They''re sometimes amusing, occasionally funny, but only very rarely interesting beyond that.  This one breaks the chain ... it''s terrific.  My new all-time favorite in the genre.  It''s just such a startling point-of-view which I have probably seen many times myself without ever having actually seen it at all.  9.', '2009-04-07 21:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424709, 777302, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think I''m spending too much time on DPC.  I think I''m starting to recognize the different photographers...  Nice alluring image...</td>', 'I think I''m spending too much time on DPC.  I think I''m starting to recognize the different photographers...  Nice alluring image...', '2009-04-07 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424713, 777921, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Title''s almost too cute, but it must have been irresistible.  It has a wonderful graphic impact just for the familiar/unfamiliar shapes of the reversed letters, and then another quieter dimension as the scene beyond introduces itself.  9.</td>', 'Very good.  Title''s almost too cute, but it must have been irresistible.  It has a wonderful graphic impact just for the familiar/unfamiliar shapes of the reversed letters, and then another quieter dimension as the scene beyond introduces itself.  9.', '2009-04-07 21:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424714, 769675, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, the colors are amazing... Nice composition</td>', 'Wow, the colors are amazing... Nice composition', '2009-04-07 21:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424715, 777722, 65234, '<td valign="top">Definitely needs a tooth cleaning!</td>', 'Definitely needs a tooth cleaning!', '2009-04-07 21:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424716, 774893, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection image, nice abstract quality.</td>', 'Nice reflection image, nice abstract quality.', '2009-04-07 21:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424719, 772864, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Thumbnail stands out.  Like the reflection of the eyes in the water. Mysterious....</td>', 'Interesting composition. Thumbnail stands out.  Like the reflection of the eyes in the water. Mysterious....', '2009-04-07 21:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424721, 770542, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice image of modern and old.  Good composition.  Brilliant colors.</td>', 'Nice image of modern and old.  Good composition.  Brilliant colors.', '2009-04-07 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424722, 777695, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry.  B&amp;W makes this an artsy image, for me...  Very nice.</td>', 'I like the symmetry.  B&W makes this an artsy image, for me...  Very nice.', '2009-04-07 21:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424725, 777412, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment.  I like the DOF.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment.  I like the DOF.', '2009-04-07 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424728, 778264, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2009-04-07 21:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424729, 778268, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is exceptional for the inspired composition.  A lesser photographer might have tried to include all of the doll, and thus would have lost all of the story.  You''re not a lesser photographer.  9.</td>', 'This is exceptional for the inspired composition.  A lesser photographer might have tried to include all of the doll, and thus would have lost all of the story.  You''re not a lesser photographer.  9.', '2009-04-07 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424735, 778530, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG he''s too cute!!  He looks totally embarassed but that''s his problem ;-)  He blends into the wall a bit; next time I''d try a more contrasting color for the background (like the green of the flowers, maybe, or good old black).</td>', 'OMG he''s too cute!!  He looks totally embarassed but that''s his problem ;-)  He blends into the wall a bit; next time I''d try a more contrasting color for the background (like the green of the flowers, maybe, or good old black).', '2009-04-07 22:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424736, 778393, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like your post processing, gives it an album cover quality.</td>', 'I like your post processing, gives it an album cover quality.', '2009-04-07 22:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424738, 777097, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the various shapes and textures.  Very nice.</td>', 'I like the composition and the various shapes and textures.  Very nice.', '2009-04-07 22:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424744, 777455, 30364, '<td valign="top">A brilliant portrait.  It harks back to those wonderful Farm Security Administration images from the 1930s and 40s but it has an altogether more optimistic character.  No evidence of despair or disorientation here.  The guy is a brilliant photographic subject, and the balance you have given him between his modest house and his loving boys makes a very fine observation about the essence of contentment.  9.</td>', 'A brilliant portrait.  It harks back to those wonderful Farm Security Administration images from the 1930s and 40s but it has an altogether more optimistic character.  No evidence of despair or disorientation here.  The guy is a brilliant photographic subject, and the balance you have given him between his modest house and his loving boys makes a very fine observation about the essence of contentment.  9.', '2009-04-07 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424745, 778541, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Hippos seem to delight in sticking as little as possible out of the water and then submerging again.  This is a good view.</td>', 'Nice.  Hippos seem to delight in sticking as little as possible out of the water and then submerging again.  This is a good view.', '2009-04-07 22:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424747, 776483, 30364, '<td valign="top">Strangely compelling.  I suppose you manufactured this juxtaposition, but it seems coherent anyway.  9.</td>', 'Strangely compelling.  I suppose you manufactured this juxtaposition, but it seems coherent anyway.  9.', '2009-04-07 22:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424750, 778670, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes; look at those eyes!!  She looks somewhat demonic =:-O  Great stop-motion shot.</td>', 'Yikes; look at those eyes!!  She looks somewhat demonic =:-O  Great stop-motion shot.', '2009-04-07 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424753, 777973, 65234, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Might benefit from a little dodging to bring out more detail on the heron.</td>', 'Neat shot!  Might benefit from a little dodging to bring out more detail on the heron.', '2009-04-07 22:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424754, 774152, 103032, '<td valign="top">It looks like the ducks rear is focused and the ducks head and breast is a touch out of focus.  Maybe check the focus point of the camera...</td>', 'It looks like the ducks rear is focused and the ducks head and breast is a touch out of focus.  Maybe check the focus point of the camera...', '2009-04-07 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424755, 778313, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Suffers a bit from the lack of a more prominent person at the fore (I mean physically prominent ... larger ... I don''t know what the guy''s financial and social status is).  But it''s still very good.  8.</td>', 'Very nice.  Suffers a bit from the lack of a more prominent person at the fore (I mean physically prominent ... larger ... I don''t know what the guy''s financial and social status is).  But it''s still very good.  8.', '2009-04-07 22:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424756, 776648, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impish ;-)  Very rich color; really brings out the eyes.</td>', 'Impish ;-)  Very rich color; really brings out the eyes.', '2009-04-07 22:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424763, 778665, 30364, '<td valign="top">If he was still here I''d give this to [user]boysetsfire[/user], but as he ain''t, you must be either Ed or Nixter.   It''s a very ''Trent Parke'' image, but of course he''s not here either.  Unless he''s slumming, of course.  9.</td>', 'If he was still here I''d give this to [user]boysetsfire[/user], but as he ain''t, you must be either Ed or Nixter.   It''s a very ''Trent Parke'' image, but of course he''s not here either.  Unless he''s slumming, of course.  9.', '2009-04-07 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424765, 778547, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not looking very happy with his/her first modelling job.  I can understand that, being held out away from warmth and security like that.</td>', 'Not looking very happy with his/her first modelling job.  I can understand that, being held out away from warmth and security like that.', '2009-04-07 22:11:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5424770, 771240, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like shallow DOF on floral shots, for the most part, but this needs just a bit more DOF IMO.  Too much is OOF in the foreground; I felt like I had to hunt for the focussed part.</td>', 'I like shallow DOF on floral shots, for the most part, but this needs just a bit more DOF IMO.  Too much is OOF in the foreground; I felt like I had to hunt for the focussed part.', '2009-04-07 22:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424771, 778237, 103032, '<td valign="top">Kinda dark.  Since main subject id looking out of the window, it may help to crop out the other person, place the red hat person to the right...</td>', 'Kinda dark.  Since main subject id looking out of the window, it may help to crop out the other person, place the red hat person to the right...', '2009-04-07 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424773, 771895, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonder-filled photograph.  Wonderful.  Crop, tongue, knee, exposure, frame; it''s all good.  9.</td>', 'Wonder-filled photograph.  Wonderful.  Crop, tongue, knee, exposure, frame; it''s all good.  9.', '2009-04-07 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424779, 778184, 103032, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little bit over exposed, but his smile looks natural and not forced.  Nicely focused.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'Maybe a little bit over exposed, but his smile looks natural and not forced.  Nicely focused.  Nice portrait.', '2009-04-07 22:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424780, 778257, 65234, '<td valign="top">Birds are nicely sharp.  Looks like they were diving for bread.  <br/> <br/>I''d clone out that bit of wing sticking into the image on the left (nitpick) and make sure the horizon is either straight or blatantly and purposefully tilted.</td>', 'Birds are nicely sharp.  Looks like they were diving for bread.   I''d clone out that bit of wing sticking into the image on the left (nitpick) and make sure the horizon is either straight or blatantly and purposefully tilted.', '2009-04-07 22:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424783, 777735, 30364, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  Easy to make a cliché out of this, but you didn''t fall for that at all.  A graphically sublime marriage of tones, colors and shapes makes this a great secret abstract.  A person of exactly the right prominence makes it something else as well.  Super duper!  9.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  Easy to make a cliché out of this, but you didn''t fall for that at all.  A graphically sublime marriage of tones, colors and shapes makes this a great secret abstract.  A person of exactly the right prominence makes it something else as well.  Super duper!  9.', '2009-04-07 22:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424786, 778386, 30364, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  A sort of literal cubism.  7.</td>', 'Excellent.  A sort of literal cubism.  7.', '2009-04-07 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424788, 778241, 30364, '<td valign="top">Rare I like an insect shot, but this is excellent.  The light is beautiful.</td>', 'Rare I like an insect shot, but this is excellent.  The light is beautiful.', '2009-04-07 22:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424789, 776452, 103032, '<td valign="top">Too much...going on.  No central subject.  Looks like a snap shot, not composed in any way...</td>', 'Too much...going on.  No central subject.  Looks like a snap shot, not composed in any way...', '2009-04-07 22:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424790, 777945, 65234, '<td valign="top">Violets?  Mine are just starting to bloom in the warmer parts of the yard.  I like the composition and DOF here, though I think the exposure is a little overbright.</td>', 'Violets?  Mine are just starting to bloom in the warmer parts of the yard.  I like the composition and DOF here, though I think the exposure is a little overbright.', '2009-04-07 22:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424793, 777131, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t like landscapes but this is a good one.  Even I can see that it is technically perfect.  Plus it''s not at all boring, which landscapes usually are.  Very nice work.</td>', 'I don''t like landscapes but this is a good one.  Even I can see that it is technically perfect.  Plus it''s not at all boring, which landscapes usually are.  Very nice work.', '2009-04-07 22:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424794, 777514, 30364, '<td valign="top">So beautifully restrained.  Great judgement and vision.</td>', 'So beautifully restrained.  Great judgement and vision.', '2009-04-07 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424798, 778669, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Piscatorial Kabuki.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Piscatorial Kabuki.', '2009-04-07 22:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424799, 775560, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and shapes in this.  Subtracting detail adds so much, sometimes!</td>', 'Lovely tones and shapes in this.  Subtracting detail adds so much, sometimes!', '2009-04-07 22:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424801, 778476, 30364, '<td valign="top">Can''t not like this.  She''s beautiful and you did a great job in knowing exactly what to do to prove it.</td>', 'Can''t not like this.  She''s beautiful and you did a great job in knowing exactly what to do to prove it.', '2009-04-07 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424803, 777419, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely illustration of forces.  It''s immensely satisfying to spend a minute or two absorbing this.</td>', 'Lovely illustration of forces.  It''s immensely satisfying to spend a minute or two absorbing this.', '2009-04-07 22:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424806, 774648, 30364, '<td valign="top">A terrific critter picture.  The lighting (which I think you have created or at least enhanced) is superb.  The darkness adds to the sinister image this guy enjoys.  Well, he looks like he enjoys it!</td>', 'A terrific critter picture.  The lighting (which I think you have created or at least enhanced) is superb.  The darkness adds to the sinister image this guy enjoys.  Well, he looks like he enjoys it!', '2009-04-07 22:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424808, 775304, 103032, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot.  An old stone archway (a castle?), can''t tell if the guy is standing in a doorway, or on top of a window sill (the dark foreground gives no clues), I think I see a couple trees beyond the opening (so is he high off the ground?), so is this guy trying to "escape," thinking about suicide?      Okay, you made me look at this image far too long wondering about the story behind it; for that I''ll give this a 7.</td>', 'An interesting shot.  An old stone archway (a castle?), can''t tell if the guy is standing in a doorway, or on top of a window sill (the dark foreground gives no clues), I think I see a couple trees beyond the opening (so is he high off the ground?), so is this guy trying to "escape," thinking about suicide?      Okay, you made me look at this image far too long wondering about the story behind it; for that I''ll give this a 7.', '2009-04-07 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424810, 769631, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simple but beautiful.  Superb compositional balance.</td>', 'Simple but beautiful.  Superb compositional balance.', '2009-04-07 22:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424816, 778323, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like how you captured motion.  Colors are nice too.  The kids looks like he''s having fun too.</td>', 'Nice, I like how you captured motion.  Colors are nice too.  The kids looks like he''s having fun too.', '2009-04-07 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424818, 778301, 30364, '<td valign="top">Strange but absorbing.  I don''t know how this happens, but it''s so appallingly familiar.  It''s a nice allegory for human relationships, isn''t it?  The choices are bewildering, some are clearly labelled, some open unexpected treasures, and some just let you jump out the window.</td>', 'Strange but absorbing.  I don''t know how this happens, but it''s so appallingly familiar.  It''s a nice allegory for human relationships, isn''t it?  The choices are bewildering, some are clearly labelled, some open unexpected treasures, and some just let you jump out the window.', '2009-04-07 22:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424821, 771895, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love this capture! What a great expression! 10</td>', 'I love this capture! What a great expression! 10', '2009-04-07 22:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424825, 778658, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy HDR</td>', 'Nice dreamy HDR', '2009-04-07 22:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424843, 777500, 103032, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I think it would have been a stronger image if you got more of the waves/water to the left since thats the direction the surfer is headed.  He seems just a bit out of focus.  Otherwise, you caught him at the peek of the wave, nice angle of the board, nice extension of the arms.  Almost a nice action shot.</td>', 'Compositionally, I think it would have been a stronger image if you got more of the waves/water to the left since thats the direction the surfer is headed.  He seems just a bit out of focus.  Otherwise, you caught him at the peek of the wave, nice angle of the board, nice extension of the arms.  Almost a nice action shot.', '2009-04-07 22:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424848, 778043, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, nice focus of the eyes.  Well done portrait.</td>', 'Nice portrait, nice focus of the eyes.  Well done portrait.', '2009-04-07 22:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424853, 775801, 103032, '<td valign="top">That''s a crazy image.... very cool</td>', 'That''s a crazy image.... very cool', '2009-04-07 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424861, 775560, 77724, '<td valign="top">This actually looks like a pinhole to me - whatever it is I like it.</td>', 'This actually looks like a pinhole to me - whatever it is I like it.', '2009-04-07 22:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424880, 778310, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like the concept.  Looks like a lot of effort to make the shot happen.  However the colors (red vest, yellow hat) look dull.  Maybe a fill light on the person''s face??? or maybe had the person sit facing the sun???  Maybe incorporate the musician as a bigger part of the image where the viewer can see the tranquility of their face???  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Like the concept.  Looks like a lot of effort to make the shot happen.  However the colors (red vest, yellow hat) look dull.  Maybe a fill light on the person''s face??? or maybe had the person sit facing the sun???  Maybe incorporate the musician as a bigger part of the image where the viewer can see the tranquility of their face???  Just my opinion.', '2009-04-07 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424892, 778025, 103032, '<td valign="top">A little too de-saturated for me.  He''s got brilliant blue eyes, maybe highlighting the eyes would have worked better</td>', 'A little too de-saturated for me.  He''s got brilliant blue eyes, maybe highlighting the eyes would have worked better', '2009-04-07 22:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424905, 775560, 103032, '<td valign="top">An abstract, but I''m not getting what you''re trying to convey...</td>', 'An abstract, but I''m not getting what you''re trying to convey...', '2009-04-07 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424927, 775407, 103032, '<td valign="top">The focus on the head/eyes seem just a tad off.  The sharp focus seems towards the rear.  I like the colors and the reflection.</td>', 'The focus on the head/eyes seem just a tad off.  The sharp focus seems towards the rear.  I like the colors and the reflection.', '2009-04-07 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424930, 778550, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.', '2009-04-07 23:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424941, 777804, 103032, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out where the focus point was.  Maybe the left petal.  My eyes are drawn to the yellow part of the flower, so a sharp focus on the yellow would be better for me... just my opinion.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out where the focus point was.  Maybe the left petal.  My eyes are drawn to the yellow part of the flower, so a sharp focus on the yellow would be better for me... just my opinion.', '2009-04-07 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424942, 777897, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It has a slightly menacing edge to it that I suppose derives partly from the interesting lighting and partly from the fact that some of the story is outside the frame.  I always prefer incomplete photographs!</td>', 'Very nice.  It has a slightly menacing edge to it that I suppose derives partly from the interesting lighting and partly from the fact that some of the story is outside the frame.  I always prefer incomplete photographs!', '2009-04-07 23:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424944, 778040, 103032, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, Oscarette... interesting</td>', 'Hmmm, Oscarette... interesting', '2009-04-07 23:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424945, 777662, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is good.  All that chaos and clutter, and the cool glimpse of a lower face in the corner ... such an intriguing interjection!</td>', 'This is good.  All that chaos and clutter, and the cool glimpse of a lower face in the corner ... such an intriguing interjection!', '2009-04-07 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424948, 778440, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful tones and a bittersweet fate for the leaf.  It has a certain nobility, transfixed there instead of lost in the litter down below.</td>', 'Very beautiful tones and a bittersweet fate for the leaf.  It has a certain nobility, transfixed there instead of lost in the litter down below.', '2009-04-07 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424952, 778484, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ridiculously anthropomorphic.  The building looks down in horror and embarrassment at the CFK so rudely applied to its belly.</td>', 'Ridiculously anthropomorphic.  The building looks down in horror and embarrassment at the CFK so rudely applied to its belly.', '2009-04-07 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424956, 778450, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nude and window; an elegant combination.</td>', 'Nude and window; an elegant combination.', '2009-04-07 23:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424957, 773207, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the HDR.  But the parking lot stuff is distracting.  Maybe if you go to the same spot, set the camera/tripod on the grass in front of this point and eliminate the parking lot and maybe the grass/embankment too.  I''m guessing you wanted to keep the yellows of the setting sun on the left in the shot....</td>', 'I like the HDR.  But the parking lot stuff is distracting.  Maybe if you go to the same spot, set the camera/tripod on the grass in front of this point and eliminate the parking lot and maybe the grass/embankment too.  I''m guessing you wanted to keep the yellows of the setting sun on the left in the shot....', '2009-04-07 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424959, 777711, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, the colors are crazy rich... cool.</td>', 'Wow, the colors are crazy rich... cool.', '2009-04-07 23:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424963, 777985, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nothing''s new under the sun, even after tens of millions of years.  Very interesting landscape (normally that''s oxymoronic, but you surprised me).</td>', 'Nothing''s new under the sun, even after tens of millions of years.  Very interesting landscape (normally that''s oxymoronic, but you surprised me).', '2009-04-07 23:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424965, 774506, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just gorgeous tones and perfect exposure.  Very fine composition too.  You seem to be OK at this photo stuff.</td>', 'Just gorgeous tones and perfect exposure.  Very fine composition too.  You seem to be OK at this photo stuff.', '2009-04-07 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424966, 777764, 103032, '<td valign="top">Too funny</td>', 'Too funny', '2009-04-07 23:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424971, 777910, 103032, '<td valign="top">But when they did, they had satellite TV....</td>', 'But when they did, they had satellite TV....', '2009-04-07 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424973, 775020, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait</td>', 'Nice portrait', '2009-04-07 23:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424977, 776541, 103032, '<td valign="top">I initially thought it was an melting ice sculpture...</td>', 'I initially thought it was an melting ice sculpture...', '2009-04-07 23:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424991, 774596, 100831, '<td valign="top">this is interesting. Nice colors. Nice perspective and a sense of mystery.</td>', 'this is interesting. Nice colors. Nice perspective and a sense of mystery.', '2009-04-07 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424992, 772077, 100831, '<td valign="top">Well done. Congrats!</td>', 'Well done. Congrats!', '2009-04-07 23:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424993, 778386, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry in black and white.</td>', 'Nice geometry in black and white.', '2009-04-07 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425006, 778481, 103032, '<td valign="top">Again, too funny</td>', 'Again, too funny', '2009-04-07 23:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425016, 778558, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great choice, Zack.  This looks awesome.  I hope it does well!</td>', 'Great choice, Zack.  This looks awesome.  I hope it does well!', '2009-04-07 23:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425017, 772993, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is close to cliché status; the people on the train station bench.  But you have avoided that, which is quite an achievement!  The green is great (by which I mean awful of course), and the bilingual rendering of the station name is also terrific.  But the best part is how you have arrayed your cast of characters. The pair, like bookends for an empty bookcase.  And the solo artist at the side, elegantly slouched in shadow but with foot and hand picked out by the stage lighting.  It looks like a set for a modern opera, and I won''t be surprised if she (the solo) begins to sing at any moment.  If she does, I''ll bet the bookends are not moved at all.  It''s a wonderful little tableau, stilled but loaded with potential energy.  10, and the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is close to cliché status; the people on the train station bench.  But you have avoided that, which is quite an achievement!  The green is great (by which I mean awful of course), and the bilingual rendering of the station name is also terrific.  But the best part is how you have arrayed your cast of characters. The pair, like bookends for an empty bookcase.  And the solo artist at the side, elegantly slouched in shadow but with foot and hand picked out by the stage lighting.  It looks like a set for a modern opera, and I won''t be surprised if she (the solo) begins to sing at any moment.  If she does, I''ll bet the bookends are not moved at all.  It''s a wonderful little tableau, stilled but loaded with potential energy.  10, and the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-04-07 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425018, 778574, 30364, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, moving photograph.  Inspired composition, great tones, and gentle murmurs of light.  Noble Capra (I mean the goat, not the photographer).  10, and the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'What a beautiful, moving photograph.  Inspired composition, great tones, and gentle murmurs of light.  Noble Capra (I mean the goat, not the photographer).  10, and the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-04-07 23:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425020, 778300, 30364, '<td valign="top">I hardly ever like staged photographs which is why I am so much taken with this one ... it first had to overcome my prejudices, and it did!  I like it so much because it is such a wonderful little story.  I think it''s about rebellion.  All the small icons of her time and her place are there; the baking stuff, the appliances, the phone, the pop, the dress, her grooming and of course the apron.  She is the perfect vision of an idealized life.  And yet, there is a tiny hint of something else; some simmering insurrection.  There''s a tiny wicked smile at her lips, and there''s the slightly racy stockings.  I wonder who she''s calling.  Probably not Dexter (or whatever hubby''s name is).  So I like it for all that and for its echoes of Frank Yates''s <i>Revolutionary Road.</i>  10, and the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I hardly ever like staged photographs which is why I am so much taken with this one ... it first had to overcome my prejudices, and it did!  I like it so much because it is such a wonderful little story.  I think it''s about rebellion.  All the small icons of her time and her place are there; the baking stuff, the appliances, the phone, the pop, the dress, her grooming and of course the apron.  She is the perfect vision of an idealized life.  And yet, there is a tiny hint of something else; some simmering insurrection.  There''s a tiny wicked smile at her lips, and there''s the slightly racy stockings.  I wonder who she''s calling.  Probably not Dexter (or whatever hubby''s name is).  So I like it for all that and for its echoes of Frank Yates''s Revolutionary Road.  10, and the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-04-08 00:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425022, 777814, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, nice composition, but too pastel for my personal taste.</td>', 'Nice portrait, nice composition, but too pastel for my personal taste.', '2009-04-08 00:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425025, 778493, 103032, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what it is, but nice colors, nice blur for the abstract.  Good image</td>', 'Don''t know what it is, but nice colors, nice blur for the abstract.  Good image', '2009-04-08 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425028, 778021, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.  Nice image</td>', 'I like the lighting.  Nice image', '2009-04-08 00:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425031, 777378, 103032, '<td valign="top">Contemporary "Stand By Me"???  Nice</td>', 'Contemporary "Stand By Me"???  Nice', '2009-04-08 00:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425035, 776942, 103142, '<td valign="top">love your title! (the picture is nice too)</td>', 'love your title! (the picture is nice too)', '2009-04-08 00:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425036, 770080, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of covering half of her face, adds mystery/intrigue.  I like the tie in of the fan and the earring.  I also like how the earring fills in the dark area.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like the concept of covering half of her face, adds mystery/intrigue.  I like the tie in of the fan and the earring.  I also like how the earring fills in the dark area.  Nice work.', '2009-04-08 00:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
