(5425316, 773900, 67145, '<td valign="top">i wonder how long you were waiting for this brilliant shot owen .. ??!!!<br/>i just dont have the patience for setting up a tripod especially if there arent that many bees around ... like three days later and i''d still be there waiting .. lol ..<br/>it really is an amazing photograph .. i doubt it could be improved upon in any way .. everything is perfect .. <br/>and its interesting too . the pollen is white instead of yellow or green like around here .. must be that''s he''s been on white flowers .. ?? .. i havent studies flowers that much to know .. but i''v only noticed yellow and green pollen on the bees around where i live .. <br/>anyway .. macros of insects who definitely have minds of their own (altho not with huge intellects!!) arent the easiest things to photograph well .. you''ve done a scorcher here .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'i wonder how long you were waiting for this brilliant shot owen .. ??!!!i just dont have the patience for setting up a tripod especially if there arent that many bees around ... like three days later and i''d still be there waiting .. lol ..it really is an amazing photograph .. i doubt it could be improved upon in any way .. everything is perfect .. and its interesting too . the pollen is white instead of yellow or green like around here .. must be that''s he''s been on white flowers .. ?? .. i havent studies flowers that much to know .. but i''v only noticed yellow and green pollen on the bees around where i live .. anyway .. macros of insects who definitely have minds of their own (altho not with huge intellects!!) arent the easiest things to photograph well .. you''ve done a scorcher here .. :) ', '2009-04-08 01:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
