(5425546, 772993, 68504, '<td valign="top">Olga sat on the bench pretending not to notice.  Sophia did not pretend, but stood casually contemplating Olga''s benchmate who was nursing a pig.  No one saw the man with the camera.</td>', 'Olga sat on the bench pretending not to notice.  Sophia did not pretend, but stood casually contemplating Olga''s benchmate who was nursing a pig.  No one saw the man with the camera.', '2009-04-08 02:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
