(5425657, 777412, 103032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Teafran:</b></div><hr/><i> And the approaching car veers to the left and so much for big city love. :&gt;)<br/> <br/>Nice capture - does nothing for me personally, but it''s interesting. As a candid it doesn''t evoke any feelings one way or the other - I''m just not moved by this at all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think this is a great image.  It tells a great story, even without seeing the faces, it totally evokes emotion.  Veeeery nice shot...<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Teafran: And the approaching car veers to the left and so much for big city love. :>) Nice capture - does nothing for me personally, but it''s interesting. As a candid it doesn''t evoke any feelings one way or the other - I''m just not moved by this at all.   I think this is a great image.  It tells a great story, even without seeing the faces, it totally evokes emotion.  Veeeery nice shot...', '2009-04-08 03:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
