(5425965, 776648, 49643, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> Brilliant work in the style that Manny Librodo made famous...congrats </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes it''s an honor to me mentioning this maestro name on my entry. I have no shame to say I am highly inspired with his amazing work. You can also see my small blog on this <a href="//blog.dreamstime.com/2009/03/18/my-inspiration-for-portrait-photography_art29089" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">My Inspiration for Portraits</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-08 07:56:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: Brilliant work in the style that Manny Librodo made famous...congrats  Yes it''s an honor to me mentioning this maestro name on my entry. I have no shame to say I am highly inspired with his amazing work. You can also see my small blog on this My Inspiration for Portraits', '2009-04-08 08:55:36.000000', '2009-04-08 08:56:41.000000', 0),
