(5426017, 777721, 100064, '<td valign="top">Ahhh. How funny it is that yesterday I was going to write a comment on this picture and say "basssman I thought you said the wolves were lazy and not worth shooting?". Now I wish I had but I was afraid it wasnt yours because of what you said.  Oh well. "Another" nice wolf shot and congrats on your h2h win.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-08 08:21:38.</i></td>', 'Ahhh. How funny it is that yesterday I was going to write a comment on this picture and say "basssman I thought you said the wolves were lazy and not worth shooting?". Now I wish I had but I was afraid it wasnt yours because of what you said.  Oh well. "Another" nice wolf shot and congrats on your h2h win.', '2009-04-08 09:20:11.000000', '2009-04-08 09:21:38.000000', 0),
