(5426342, 777758, 52115, '<td valign="top">Well done! It reminds me of the lithographs done by one of my favorite  artists,  M.C. Escher, titled "relativity".<br/> <br/>I like the minimal Red, but strong in emphasis. The eye is carried in a circular path, to the first red-nova, then, to the next two red-sweaters, seemingly, strategically placed. Kind of like "Connect the red dots" to arrive at the masses below.</td>', 'Well done! It reminds me of the lithographs done by one of my favorite  artists,  M.C. Escher, titled "relativity". I like the minimal Red, but strong in emphasis. The eye is carried in a circular path, to the first red-nova, then, to the next two red-sweaters, seemingly, strategically placed. Kind of like "Connect the red dots" to arrive at the masses below.', '2009-04-08 10:49:50.000000', NULL, 0),
