(5427519, 777758, 20608, '<td valign="top">I am overwhelmed by your comments thank you so much, I am absolutely bowled over and as suggested by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=3746" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">simms</a> I will send this over to the museum and ask if I can re-shoot it when there are no tourists about... well, I might just take 1 person along and plce them in the frame somewhere extremely interesting.<br/> <br/>Thanks again for all your kind words and the favs.</td>', 'I am overwhelmed by your comments thank you so much, I am absolutely bowled over and as suggested by  simms I will send this over to the museum and ask if I can re-shoot it when there are no tourists about... well, I might just take 1 person along and plce them in the frame somewhere extremely interesting. Thanks again for all your kind words and the favs.', '2009-04-08 19:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
