(5428085, 778313, 31637, '<td valign="top">This composition is phenomenal! San Fran''s pretty dippy! No where on Earth can you get a street shot like this, great eye....(time to nitpick) exposure could be a bit better, contrast is good, but try re-doing this so your foreground is brighter; those cheap lenses are horrible past 60mm, unless it''s bright as hell outside, I know what ya mean.</td>', 'This composition is phenomenal! San Fran''s pretty dippy! No where on Earth can you get a street shot like this, great eye....(time to nitpick) exposure could be a bit better, contrast is good, but try re-doing this so your foreground is brighter; those cheap lenses are horrible past 60mm, unless it''s bright as hell outside, I know what ya mean.', '2009-04-08 21:58:01.000000', NULL, 0),
