(5428544, 775560, 68504, '<td valign="top">All mood, yes.  What is startling and revelatory to me is that I need to look at it from further away, and this brings everything into question.  Like reinventing impressionism.<br/> <br/>ETA: And what if you did make a big print - it might be awesome.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-09 02:48:40.</i></td>', 'All mood, yes.  What is startling and revelatory to me is that I need to look at it from further away, and this brings everything into question.  Like reinventing impressionism. ETA: And what if you did make a big print - it might be awesome.', '2009-04-09 03:47:18.000000', '2009-04-09 03:48:40.000000', 0),
