(5429189, 777921, 11793, '<td valign="top">awesome !<br/> <br/>why didn''t you flip it to right the letters ?  i suppose that is part if the intrerest.  i''d have a hard time making that choice...<br/> <br/>taken with a cell phone to boot !@<br/> <br/></td>', 'awesome ! why didn''t you flip it to right the letters ?  i suppose that is part if the intrerest.  i''d have a hard time making that choice... taken with a cell phone to boot !@ ', '2009-04-09 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429281, 778316, 68586, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and nice processing.</td>', 'Cool shot and nice processing.', '2009-04-09 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429364, 777758, 24454, '<td valign="top">MAK!  CONGRATULATIONS, Buddy!  What an AMAZING photo!  Such a tribute to your mad skills and eye winning the top spot in a free study!  You are AWESOME!<br/></td>', 'MAK!  CONGRATULATIONS, Buddy!  What an AMAZING photo!  Such a tribute to your mad skills and eye winning the top spot in a free study!  You are AWESOME!', '2009-04-09 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429368, 778280, 24454, '<td valign="top">Bragi, you never let us down with your spectacular presentations of Iceland!    Congratulations on your award for this stunning photography!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Bragi, you never let us down with your spectacular presentations of Iceland!    Congratulations on your award for this stunning photography! ', '2009-04-09 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429370, 769675, 24454, '<td valign="top">And you had a verrrrrrrry good week, didn''t you!  And <i><b>most</b></i> deservingly so, I might add :)  I don''t even have a superlative for this kind of beauty!<br/> <br/></td>', 'And you had a verrrrrrrry good week, didn''t you!  And most deservingly so, I might add :)  I don''t even have a superlative for this kind of beauty! ', '2009-04-09 14:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429371, 770542, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Kinda cliche, but a gushy enough superlative is escaping me at the moment!  Congratulations on so many levels!<br/> <br/></td>', 'WOW!  Kinda cliche, but a gushy enough superlative is escaping me at the moment!  Congratulations on so many levels! ', '2009-04-09 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429375, 778288, 24454, '<td valign="top">You must have felt like you had died and woken up in Heaven to wake up to this!!   Thanks for sharing your Heaven experience with us!</td>', 'You must have felt like you had died and woken up in Heaven to wake up to this!!   Thanks for sharing your Heaven experience with us!', '2009-04-09 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429378, 775433, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh MAN!  That is truly spectacular.  I''m so glad he didn''t have a dead something in his mouth.  This has to be in the top very few "Best Wildlife" photos of all time!   I"m in awe!</td>', 'Oh MAN!  That is truly spectacular.  I''m so glad he didn''t have a dead something in his mouth.  This has to be in the top very few "Best Wildlife" photos of all time!   I"m in awe!', '2009-04-09 14:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429381, 778284, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  What a heartwarming photo!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  What a heartwarming photo!', '2009-04-09 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429383, 778237, 61651, '<td valign="top">So close and yet so far away - the richness of the colors suits this image perfectly.</td>', 'So close and yet so far away - the richness of the colors suits this image perfectly.', '2009-04-09 14:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429388, 778665, 61651, '<td valign="top">Goodness, how do you find these things?  And that shadow so neatly underlines "stopping".  Great work.</td>', 'Goodness, how do you find these things?  And that shadow so neatly underlines "stopping".  Great work.', '2009-04-09 14:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429393, 777862, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very compelling shot - deceptively simple, but draws you in.</td>', 'Very compelling shot - deceptively simple, but draws you in.', '2009-04-09 14:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429396, 776417, 24454, '<td valign="top">I obsessively try to capture "the perfect" hummingbird photo.  This is pretty darn close!  I''m so encouraged that IF I ever get one good enough to enter into a challenge -- the good ones are still getting great scores.  Congratulations on this one.   And I think: 1 out of every 400 sounds about right :)   But if they end up turning out like this -- it is well worth the bad ones :)  CONGRATULATIONS!<br/></td>', 'I obsessively try to capture "the perfect" hummingbird photo.  This is pretty darn close!  I''m so encouraged that IF I ever get one good enough to enter into a challenge -- the good ones are still getting great scores.  Congratulations on this one.   And I think: 1 out of every 400 sounds about right :)   But if they end up turning out like this -- it is well worth the bad ones :)  CONGRATULATIONS!', '2009-04-09 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429405, 775571, 24454, '<td valign="top">I never cease to stare at your work in awe.  I really didn''t think it possible -- even from the best of the best -- to achieve detail like this.  I know you guys are getting ready to go into autumn there.  Will you still be able to find interesting bugs and things over the fall and winter?   I sure hope so.  Because you are my inspiration.  I can''t wait to get my macro lens and start practicing again.  I''m not letting myself take pictures again tho until I finish some wedding photos that are ''bout to kill me.<br/> <br/>Congratulations, Roz!  And I know you''ve been on a quest to raise that overall average score received, so I am really excited for how close you are inching up towards an overall average of 6+   When you get there, let''s celebrate, okay?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-09 13:28:56.</i></td>', 'I never cease to stare at your work in awe.  I really didn''t think it possible -- even from the best of the best -- to achieve detail like this.  I know you guys are getting ready to go into autumn there.  Will you still be able to find interesting bugs and things over the fall and winter?   I sure hope so.  Because you are my inspiration.  I can''t wait to get my macro lens and start practicing again.  I''m not letting myself take pictures again tho until I finish some wedding photos that are ''bout to kill me. Congratulations, Roz!  And I know you''ve been on a quest to raise that overall average score received, so I am really excited for how close you are inching up towards an overall average of 6+   When you get there, let''s celebrate, okay?', '2009-04-09 14:28:41.000000', '2009-04-09 14:28:56.000000', 0),
(5429417, 771956, 24454, '<td valign="top">Dawn, this is such an amazing photo!  It looks like you had a very slow shutter speed to get that dreamy water and sand -- yet the birds are so amazingly crisp and sharp!  I''m in awe!  Congratulations!!!<br/> <br/>I hope you have been doing great!!  :)<br/> <br/>Oh, and P.S.:  I definitely agree with Citymars and not Teafran about the negative space thing.  That''s what makes this so striking is the minimalist effect of those birds in that sea of soft dreamy bokeh!</td>', 'Dawn, this is such an amazing photo!  It looks like you had a very slow shutter speed to get that dreamy water and sand -- yet the birds are so amazingly crisp and sharp!  I''m in awe!  Congratulations!!! I hope you have been doing great!!  :) Oh, and P.S.:  I definitely agree with Citymars and not Teafran about the negative space thing.  That''s what makes this so striking is the minimalist effect of those birds in that sea of soft dreamy bokeh!', '2009-04-09 14:47:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429421, 777758, 64446, '<td valign="top">I knew it!!! Congratulations!!! Most well deserved blue!!!</td>', 'I knew it!!! Congratulations!!! Most well deserved blue!!!', '2009-04-09 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429432, 776490, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Michelle!!!  I have always had such a thing for Llamas.  They are one of my favorite animals, but I don''t think I have ever seen a photo of one that I liked better!  This just ooozes with interest and personality.  A PERFECT title!   I think if it were me handing out ribbons. . .this one just may have very well gotten one!  Its going straight to my favorites.<br/></td>', 'Oh Michelle!!!  I have always had such a thing for Llamas.  They are one of my favorite animals, but I don''t think I have ever seen a photo of one that I liked better!  This just ooozes with interest and personality.  A PERFECT title!   I think if it were me handing out ribbons. . .this one just may have very well gotten one!  Its going straight to my favorites.', '2009-04-09 14:57:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429441, 775020, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so so striking and beautiful, Enzo!  You can really feel the connection between the photographer and his subject.  A tribute to the dignity and warmth you gave this beautiful girl.   God BLESS your work there!  And please keep sharing your photos.  This is the type of photography that I am the most passionate about.  Your work goes way beyond just making a good score in a challenge where chances are, they were mostly looking for Iceland landscapes anyway :)   Keep up the great work -- both photographically and Kingdom related! <br/> <br/></td>', 'This is so so striking and beautiful, Enzo!  You can really feel the connection between the photographer and his subject.  A tribute to the dignity and warmth you gave this beautiful girl.   God BLESS your work there!  And please keep sharing your photos.  This is the type of photography that I am the most passionate about.  Your work goes way beyond just making a good score in a challenge where chances are, they were mostly looking for Iceland landscapes anyway :)   Keep up the great work -- both photographically and Kingdom related!  ', '2009-04-09 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5429446, 773900, 24454, '<td valign="top">OhMY!  This has to be one of the most fabulous bee photos I''ve ever seen.   In flight!  I bet I''ve taken 2,000 tries of bees in flight with my macro lens and all I get is a dull, blurry mess.  Bravo!!!  You could not have done better!<br/> <br/></td>', 'OhMY!  This has to be one of the most fabulous bee photos I''ve ever seen.   In flight!  I bet I''ve taken 2,000 tries of bees in flight with my macro lens and all I get is a dull, blurry mess.  Bravo!!!  You could not have done better! ', '2009-04-09 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 0),
