(5429452, 778313, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an amazing photo!  I remember being so struck by the steep up and down streets in San Francisco, but I had forgotten just HOW up and down and steep they are.  I''d hate to be a runner in San Francisco!  But then, I guess those are the ones in the best shape in the world.  Jeeeeez.   <br/> <br/></td>', 'What an amazing photo!  I remember being so struck by the steep up and down streets in San Francisco, but I had forgotten just HOW up and down and steep they are.  I''d hate to be a runner in San Francisco!  But then, I guess those are the ones in the best shape in the world.  Jeeeeez.    ', '2009-04-09 15:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
