(5430460, 778458, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think Andrew summed it up pretty good there.  Most of your low scorers have probably not been involved in taking bird shots.  I personally think it''s hard to get a good photo of them.  I think this looks great for having been shot thru a screen!  It gave the background a very interesting textured look that I liked a lot.</td>', 'I think Andrew summed it up pretty good there.  Most of your low scorers have probably not been involved in taking bird shots.  I personally think it''s hard to get a good photo of them.  I think this looks great for having been shot thru a screen!  It gave the background a very interesting textured look that I liked a lot.', '2009-04-10 11:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
