(5430907, 778280, 80096, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 and it still amazes me to look at this, it''s perhaps one of the best images I''ve seen to date. Everything about this is perfection with a touch of surrealism for added measure. You were, without a doubt, at the right place at the right time. Congratulations!!!</td>', 'I gave this a 10 and it still amazes me to look at this, it''s perhaps one of the best images I''ve seen to date. Everything about this is perfection with a touch of surrealism for added measure. You were, without a doubt, at the right place at the right time. Congratulations!!!', '2009-04-10 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
