(5431680, 777549, 96721, '<td valign="top">This is actually quite a nice shot Janine, however (sharpness aside) it lacks that something extra that is needed for a FS entry to score well. Had this been entered in to say a bridges challenge it would have done far better.<br/> <br/>I suffered the same fate this month because I entered a shot that I personally really liked rather than one I knew would go 6+</td>', 'This is actually quite a nice shot Janine, however (sharpness aside) it lacks that something extra that is needed for a FS entry to score well. Had this been entered in to say a bridges challenge it would have done far better. I suffered the same fate this month because I entered a shot that I personally really liked rather than one I knew would go 6+', '2009-04-11 04:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
