(5491558, 777758, 16912, '<td valign="top">Hey Marac! I''m not a big fan of HDR (maybe because I turn out rubbish) but this is just WOW! well worth the blue and, imho one of your better works. and, look at the curves both in the image and voting, I don''t think I''ve seen another image with 5 being the lowest vote though am sure there are some out there?<br/> <br/>There has been mention of no people in the shot but I agree with those that prefer people to give life to the image and would like you to visit sometime with tripod (if allowed) and use a longer shutter to get tome motion blur inn the peeps.<br/> <br/>I don''t click the fav button often but feel compelled to with this shot sir!</td>', 'Hey Marac! I''m not a big fan of HDR (maybe because I turn out rubbish) but this is just WOW! well worth the blue and, imho one of your better works. and, look at the curves both in the image and voting, I don''t think I''ve seen another image with 5 being the lowest vote though am sure there are some out there? There has been mention of no people in the shot but I agree with those that prefer people to give life to the image and would like you to visit sometime with tripod (if allowed) and use a longer shutter to get tome motion blur inn the peeps. I don''t click the fav button often but feel compelled to with this shot sir!', '2009-05-18 18:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5492552, 778317, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot Wayne. I like the reflection on the train tracks.</td>', 'Great shot Wayne. I like the reflection on the train tracks.', '2009-05-19 15:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5493105, 775722, 39427, '<td valign="top">I def see what you were going for Doc and I actually think the shot is great but I do believe the dodging of the stars to be a tad heavy handed and unnecessary for the image, I like the flare and headlights but the stars bring the photo into the realm of digital art imo</td>', 'I def see what you were going for Doc and I actually think the shot is great but I do believe the dodging of the stars to be a tad heavy handed and unnecessary for the image, I like the flare and headlights but the stars bring the photo into the realm of digital art imo', '2009-05-20 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5495041, 777691, 96534, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful Ameed, I can''t believe it didn''t do better. It just shows that people don''t see beauty when its staring them in the face! Its now one of my favourite images, I hope you do many more like this.</td>', 'This is just beautiful Ameed, I can''t believe it didn''t do better. It just shows that people don''t see beauty when its staring them in the face! Its now one of my favourite images, I hope you do many more like this.', '2009-05-21 04:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
