(5572479, 775279, 93565, '<td valign="top">I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=88204" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">choltmeier</a> about how striking this photo is considering the blue of the eyes. What really draws me, however, is how it seemingly looks as though he is in a warzone. I know he isn''t, but the nice blur imparted by the aperture choice makes it noticeable. The pedestrians looks as though they are humping packs and the overall lack of color and defintiion remind one of a warzone. Great job.</td>', 'I agree with  choltmeier about how striking this photo is considering the blue of the eyes. What really draws me, however, is how it seemingly looks as though he is in a warzone. I know he isn''t, but the nice blur imparted by the aperture choice makes it noticeable. The pedestrians looks as though they are humping packs and the overall lack of color and defintiion remind one of a warzone. Great job.', '2009-07-14 07:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5574761, 777921, 46314, '<td valign="top">Wow. I think this one deserved a much higher score. Great shot. Has a very ''classic'' feel to it. Could have been one of the ''40s/''50s masters...</td>', 'Wow. I think this one deserved a much higher score. Great shot. Has a very ''classic'' feel to it. Could have been one of the ''40s/''50s masters...', '2009-07-15 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
